---
const faqs = [
  {
    q: 'When can I download it?',
    a: 'TripSplit is coming to the App Store very soon, for iPhone, iPhone Duo and Apple Watch.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Do my friends need the app to split costs?',
    a: 'No. Add anyone by name. Everyone with the app sees the same trip and balances update for all of them.',
  },
  {
    q: 'How does Quick convert get its rates?',
    a: 'Rates refresh through the day and are saved on your device, so converting works without signal.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Can I plan costs before I go?',
    a: 'Yes. Log flights, deposits and bookings as planned, then mark them paid when they happen.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Which currencies are supported?',
    a: 'All major currencies. Every expense is converted back to your home currency so the total is always real.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Is my spending private?',
    a: 'Your trips sync through your iCloud account. Amounts can be hidden on the watch face when your wrist is down.',
  },
];
---

<section id="faq" class="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
  <h2 class="faq-h2" id="faq-title">Questions</h2>
  <div class="list">
    {
      faqs.map((f) => (
        <details class="sf">
          <summary>
            {f.q}
            <span class="plus" aria-hidden="true">
              +
            </span>
          </summary>
          <p>{f.a}</p>
        </details>
      ))
    }
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .faq {
    padding: 120px 24px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 36px;
  }
  .faq-h2 {
    font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 64px);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
  }
  .list {
    width: min(100%, 760px);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  details {
    border-radius: 22px;
    padding: 20px 24px;
  }
  summary {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 800;
  }
  .plus {
    width: 30px;
    height: 30px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--acSoft);
    color: var(--acText);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 800;
    transition: transform 0.2s;
  }
  details[open] .plus {
    transform: rotate(45deg);
  }
  p {
    margin-top: 12px;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--ink2);
    font-weight: 500;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }
</style>
